[1] Lemma V (exact, small n): with u := s - t,
    (U) log h_n(s) - log h_n(t) <= log E_t[k^{-u}],   (D) log h_n(s) - log h_n(t) >= -log E_t[k^{u}]
   p=0.5: done
   p=1.0: done
   p=2.0: done
   min slack over all (p, t, u, n): 0.00882241  (both inequalities hold: True)

